    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7243f441df4a75ed6d2b38cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我比任何人都强！！\r\n是最强的刚志哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8d8335f359583a2e300e418dcbe3f56fcb9850765ec8adc590c80766e461123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c1f66075e683b7cc0895b84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体状况万全！！\r\n我会全力以赴的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac7b8e87fc6833bf08a445748976a61c56ccb7d4e413f89a9f4ab28657cb854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afc4c1e58a14430577c8964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想获胜的心情不会输给任何人！\r\n绝对要！获胜~~~~！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "289dc86e83b3e523cc0002d52a937f654e89bbff23e1610056b8614b2ffbf7a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d8efbdc717e2a05c0d0187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我来个绝杀！\r\n您就安心观战吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "301d44ceb18b721b1facd70d1743be336f7a4fb118f90795b7e37bd4a8f9c4d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05467df83693ad3716ab9b8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态绝佳！\r\n刘海都卷翘起来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "993bbdfef6791431e0874e9bf71679136a934a1d1ac88e68b3b5482f313b8736",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01e41b29dd48469048979cb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘶，哈——\r\n嗯，呼吸也调整好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ebf173308c1cf746a02e1c12181d854de06e76a1c2a9baf6700657534e0e7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c4719576c87f0f273639b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，没问题。\r\n应该能发挥出平常的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ff3cbf7ec445d5f8a141d61c26714a4fe4ca0bf123c575614ef174bb1ec10a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37ed12ed4f8945d8e8087615",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了今天一直都在努力。\r\n只管把成果都拿出来就好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11095113c4ee4d5e97f1a49e4c4169ea9c25e25a26c686181c71d3feb7af52ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df50b1a9120505979742c877",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支持着我的人们都在，\r\n我必须得全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7db6417cb8507d1e02f487a38b3114ca093d387267e586804025d76060cdadf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4712644eb746e4141a2c4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……气色很差？没有的事，\r\n我现在干劲十足！\r\n绝对没问题的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a7cc8df550f3d01a1f77980dfc2afe7e72f6790bb1b64f2042369faac62c115",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11efc0495df792433f409e55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想想至今为止\r\n完成过的事——咳咳咳……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "748f0737b39e69f396c764e08c6b1354cc20137afcb8081bbf17dfba1f816a86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f574ae76672f5c9eaec6b34d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油刚志……\r\n不要输啊刚志……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1768c538ef7ecb81d90ea7bfc57a5a5053f9c33feb83be2202b228bf6cbc7549",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7da3425c4935f983a23a5e26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜——身体在发抖……\r\n这只不过是临阵抖擞、\r\n临阵抖擞……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a663610e65360a2fe42177a0b5a30f189a6cf5a541d25cb12e6ed8c2e77431e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9577307ac7c8d74650b63a07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呕……！！！\r\n没事……！刚才的只是类似打嗝的身体反应……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f721cfb6b58c2c506092dd4292906cb48267f635b650a8f15686ffe2bb5fd3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1fe0601cc9a77401eb1a75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "视野没有天旋地转……\r\n脑袋也没有昏昏沉沉…！\r\n都只是错觉而已……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67b2f0b9cdeba6db37bec1cc5fd6c886648e106b87d07fe0042350e6c16d0765",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
