      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096b348ae8ebc829f58db538",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种的也不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9e66d1154829eeaf74488edb2953b4386f9ef0c9a9e04cbb4c7f8c3b32fc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c48cd82a0af675dd40ad300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也不知道合不合适？\r\n看起来怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c7219c1c92f98f26bd238d379d0a0bcd3ddce4ef643a649b8ad80b0c147c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c91af325d94182a47e494cfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252dd2f8884868c153e3d4da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\r\n今天早上也做了锻炼，\r\n所以现在很清醒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7509725d8f0348b7804ffe2f219ab13c345422aaa6207a09e3edf33882a4b0d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74980975a30ac98fc8f6700",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说……早上喝白开水对身体好\r\n就试了一下，结果有点太烫了\r\n舌头还……嘶，好烫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "185aa3bd2dae3a78aa7901d4b7db68058581cb0bc61cb59b3c0045f6240bb4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc99664389b9242a9e7c70a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃了好多好多饭，还吃了\r\n好多好多的菜，现在营养满满，\r\n浑身是劲！……唔嗝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f2333e755aa820dce7116d6b6a9707a915682b37563f67853ea6b987376e08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:273bebae57e060c6bffdf34c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午反而容易睡着呢……\r\n干脆以后就以午睡为主好了\r\n啊不行不行！得正确努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a87984ab9e0a80e8e7e068599e7d4556a3853f5c00506bcdeacdac6c488627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3c89505ebde69c177bd1b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天也要早起晨练……\r\n啊，当然也得好好保证睡眠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5042d161585cc09447effd30050083b2d21314808fd9ef8b844fd1028c01d9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159704fbdc515166e6ddb9d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妹妹该给我发LANE了——正想着\r\n弟弟也发来了！欸嘿嘿，\r\n今天会发来什么呢~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ffb2e29d343e7f39e67da562f8f68f0fe7bf7e805709b80fe90f946179cb3cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c93e9dcb05745377668284",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸溜……训练员，\r\n要小心花粉过敏哦……真的真的\r\n会很难受的……吸溜溜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e0d057440ffd94d43b48c776f859a7802fca4ab7431b88dd500748a8c0d120e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79f4e3eb36318bf9f2726aa1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想给发明空调的人发个大奖啊……\r\n如果没有空调，我现在会是\r\n什么样子呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74ad04b11c820a44a1771f740c430f31410511634ea4f90a5cc6430fd5c65ddf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac3ec901f802cde7eb25cd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是有着很多大型比赛，\r\n让人精神紧绷的时期呢。\r\n……嗯，我也要加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dff423c1390ff55e06d4cd036e04f8a69eced8e2741c9536b4afae74ca69dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:690c157908181dfd31849fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会下雪吗~？小的时候只能\r\n从房间里看到，要是能\r\n触碰到的话会很让人开心呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42fda65950276d6b0d47b2eb1e00df8b1a811014cd5bc614ba141d12a7dc6916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c893bd9d9c07a7503a3d595",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
